label emergency_kit
Sienna: This feels like it’s the emergency kit.
Sienna opens the small bag and feels for the flashlight.
join Item (Flashlight) center
Sienna: Aha!
Sienna: Let there be light!
leave Item
Sienna: Huh?
join Ghost center
Ghost: Sienna…
Ghost: Lend me your body.
Ghost: I want to live too.
Sienna: Stop, you’re not real…
Sienna: I’m just hallucinating!
Sienna: This life is finally mine with you gone!
Ghost: I deserve to be happy too.
set {bag_firsttime} = false
do QteManager.start_challenge()
leave Ghost [animation="Instant Out"]